@? included Basic @|@|

@<Basic@/summary@=
Some common filters used by other modules.
@

Executes the input as a script, the input must have a shebang,
use the output of that script as the output.

@<Basic@/evaluate@=#!/bin/sh
set -e
temp_file=`mktemp`
cat - > $temp_file
chmod +x $temp_file
$temp_file
rm $temp_file
@

@! included Basic @
@
